OL,3,GNEWSAWind farm would cause radar
OL,4,A'interference' - MOD
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Defence (MOD) has
OL,7,Fobjected to plans for a wind farm on
OL,8,Fmoorland near the Yorkshire Dales,
OL,9,Fclaiming it would cause "unacceptable
OL,10,Finterference" to radar.
OL,12,FFred. Olsen Renewables is seeking
OL,13,Fpermission to build 23 turbines more
OL,14,Fthan 200m (656ft) high on land between
OL,15,FArkengarthdale and Teesdale.
OL,17,FThe MOD stated it would also cause a
OL,18,F"physical obstruction" to low-flying
OL,19,Faircraft.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
