OL,3,GNEWSAWind farm would cause radar
OL,4,A'interference' - MOD
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe renewable energy developer said it
OL,7,Fwas working with the MOD, other
OL,8,Fstakeholders and the local community to
OL,9,Faddress potential impacts and find
OL,10,F"practical solutions where needed".
